### Get banks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/banks

### Update bank
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/banks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arab Bank"
}

### Find unkown bank
GET http://localhost:8080/banks/999

### Create duplicate bank
POST http://localhost:8080/banks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arab Bank"
